566:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence
568:The corrections desk ships multiple notices per field. When several notices
569:target the same transaction and field, the notice with the lexicographically
570:greatest `effective` date wins. For each winning notice, `previous_value` in
571:`reconciliation_report.jsonl` is the field value immediately before that notice
572:applies (after ledger, amendments, and emails). Owner corrections override
573:both ledger owners and signed meeting amendments when applied in this step.
